  "title": "Flocks, Friends and Hearts: greg, am, cord and sent",
  "short": "greg means flock, am means love or friend, cord means heart and sent means feel.",
  "trouble": "inimical hides am (in + amicus, \"not friendly\"). egregious once meant standing out from the flock in a good way.",
