  "lesson": {
    "blocks": [
      {
        "t": "p",
        "html": "Four Latin roots describe people together. <b>greg</b> means “flock”: a <i>congregation</i> is a flock gathered together. <b>am</b> (also <b>amic</b>) means “love” or “friend”: an <i>amateur</i> does something for the love of it. <b>cord</b> means “heart”: to <i>record</i> once meant to learn by heart. <b>sent</b> (also <b>sens</b>) means “feel”: <i>sense</i>, <i>sentiment</i>, <i>consent</i>."
      },
      {
