      {
        "t": "key",
        "html": "<b>greg</b> = <b>flock, herd</b>. <b>am</b>, <b>amic</b> = <b>love, friend</b>. <b>cord</b> = <b>heart</b>. <b>sent</b>, <b>sens</b> = <b>feel, think</b>."
      },
      {
        "t": "p",
        "html": "The <i>greg</i> words picture people as a flock. A <b>gregarious</b> person loves to be with the flock. To <b>congregate</b> is to flock together, and to <b>segregate</b> is to set apart from the flock (<i>se-</i>, apart). An <b>aggregate</b> is many things flocked together into one total."
      },
      {
        "t": "h",
        "text": "The parts and their words"
      },
      {
